<!DOCTYPE RCC>
<!--
  SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Yakub Rabiutheen <yakub.rabiutheen@gmail.com>
  SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0

  Toska's welcome page background. krita/CMakeLists.txt compiles this file into the app only when KRITA_APP_OWN_WELCOME
  is 1 (the build named Toska, cmake/modules/KritaAppIdentity.cmake); every other build has no :/welcome resource at
  all. KisWelcomePageWidget loads the alias only when KisAppIdentity::hasOwnWelcome() says so. The painting is the
  artist's artwork (toska/README.md).
-->
<RCC version="1.0">
    <qresource prefix="/welcome">
        <file alias="toska-welcome.jpg">toska/toska-welcome.jpg</file>
    </qresource>
</RCC>
